{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_01",
  "title": "我有一個榮美家鄉",
  "storyCode": "HE-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ab05b918e6b56bc6ac1df6f6c24bc3429786e52d462e768b76f0eca61dc25585",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g9_monasteryroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個字跡，果然是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“本不可能有交集的人們”“不分彼此”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實，在最初看到那樣的景象時，我也有些懷疑自己的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只是作為我個人來說的話，真希望這樣難得的和平能一直一直持續下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆安小姐，你在忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前你提過的那種正在流行的圖案，我和其他人嘗試著繡了一些在被褥上，你看這樣對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看......嗯嗯，你們的手藝很好呢，這個就算擺在商店裡賣，我也不會感到奇怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒你誇的這麼厲害......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在天氣涼了，蕾繆安小姐這裡的被褥可能不大保暖，大家就湊了點布料送過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝關心~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過給我的話，你們那裡會不會不夠用？還是優先分給大家吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別看我這樣，其實我很強壯，不會輕易生病的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我們沒關係的，大夥分一分多少還是沒問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是蕾繆安小姐，看著也不像是很強壯的樣子啊，拉特蘭也真是的，怎麼派蕾繆安小姐出這麼遠的門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，這個嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個問題，我也很想問一問我的上級呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g7_chapel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼我們不回去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德爾菲娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_936_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為萊蒙德他們不能和我們一起！這個理由還不足夠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德爾菲娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_936_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你要拋下他們？我做不到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（笨蛋菲娜，難道我看起來是這麼冷血的人嗎？要把從小一起長大的朋友丟下，這我當然也做不到啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（可是繼續像現在這樣僵持下去也不是辦法，最近大家脾氣都開始變壞了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（真的就沒有什麼更好的解決方法了嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了，怎麼又唉聲歎氣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真稀奇，怎麼就你一個人，德爾菲娜竟然沒和你在一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊蒙德！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這話什麼意思，我和菲娜也不是時時刻刻都在一起吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧，你們不是關係好得就差睡一張床了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們有時候是會一起睡......呃，不對，重點不是這個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什麼時候回來的？我聽說你跟著杰拉爾德叔叔出去狩獵了，這次還順利嗎？有沒有受傷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你受傷了一定要說出來，千萬別學杰拉爾德叔叔，什麼都自己忍著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，你別瞎操心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我瞎操心？上回受傷不說最後傷口發炎的人是誰？私自去礦脈差點回不來的又是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好，算我錯了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？“算你錯了”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是我錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "福爾圖娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我來是想問問你，你......還有德爾菲娜，當然，也包括其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是想問，你們要不要和我們一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青年的話語在中途停住了。\n他忽然沉默起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊蒙德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了，沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一會我要出去一趟，可能得晚一點回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "福爾圖娜，晚餐前你能來樓頂的聖堂一趟嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把德爾菲娜也喊上......我有件事要告訴你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g4_gatheringplace_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看，這是什麼情況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們在修道院旁邊還建了一條街？這都建到移動地塊邊緣去了......修道院裡的空間有這麼緊張嗎？明明看起來大得很欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的人口有這麼多嗎？要養活一大群人不容易吧......特別還是在這樣的荒野中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進去看看就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？啊，從裡面走過來，應該是當地的居民吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫曼那傢伙，到底去哪了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨，看不清臉的帥哥，下午好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！什麼人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "光環......你們是薩科塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你們是什麼人，有什麼目的，都不許再靠近了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛見面，別這麼劍拔弩張，大家都和氣一點，哎，好好說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "午安，這位先生，我們三人來自拉特蘭，不是什麼可疑人物，請別緊張......如果能把你手上的武器收起來就更好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭的人來這種荒郊野嶺有何貴幹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我們是受教宗閣下派遣，來這裡尋找我們的兩位同僚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在浪費時間，里凱萊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從表現來看，我認為他很清楚我們的身份與來此的動機，並且懷有敵意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對拉特蘭很反感，表現出了明顯的排斥以及不滿。你的敵意從何而來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道你在說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一直站在通向側方街道的入口處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在有意擋住我們的視線。你不希望我們關注那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡面有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這傢伙——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，也不必這樣挑釁對方，費德里科！雖然我清楚你大概沒那個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒忘記教宗閣下給你的任務吧？低調、低調，可千萬別像之前一樣亂來啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有挑釁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，你們這些拉特蘭人就是這樣，突然出現，把一切都攪得一團亂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從資料上看，這裡的狀況本就不容樂觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你再說一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想動手嗎？來啊，我奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊還真是劍拔弩張......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝費德里科總能吸引所有目光，偷跑比我想的要輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過那個戴兜帽的傢伙......唔，確實不太對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，之後再算這筆帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得先把人找到才行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，蕾繆安，讓我猜猜看，你會在什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g2_abandonsancturay"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來今天會是客人很多的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，杰拉爾德先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本以為能在這裡見到斯特凡諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主教閣下還有不少事務要處理，剛剛才離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想他應該還沒走多遠，以您的腳力，現在追上去應該還來得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你今天還沒有拉響琴弦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您喜歡我的琴聲的話，我可以現在就為您演奏一曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你給一些......我們的人帶來了快樂，對此我很感激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但並不是所有人都可以從你的音樂中得到安慰的，至少我不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道像你這樣的音樂家為何會在這個地方逗留......我只希望你不會為這裡帶來災難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您太高看我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據我所知，災難總是在最初就被埋藏在土壤裡，而後生根發芽，開花結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果這片花圃裡真有這麼一粒種子，那麼它遲早會破土而出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我......充其量只是一個將這一切納入眼簾的過客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不會有什麼不該發芽的種子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不了多久，一切都會回歸正軌，不會有意外，更不會有災難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，請不要做多餘的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是您給我的忠告？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我的警告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是有夠不講情面，不過沒有直接動手，應該已經算是很手下留情了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該說不愧是老前輩嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破舊的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漂亮的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破舊的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，今天確實是客人很多的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請進，意料之外的小客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破舊的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫破舊的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_929_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_490_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫作阿爾圖羅，可以知道你們的名字嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g4_gatheringplace_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，別這麼說話，費德里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的發言並沒有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之你暫時先別說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有這位小兄弟，別衝動，我們真的只是來找下落不明的同事，不管你，嗯，不管你是什麼人，我們都沒有敵意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，說得好聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你管他這樣的叫沒有敵意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，我可以發誓。總之......可以先放我們進去嗎？如果方便通知一下這邊的負責人就最好不過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯普莉雅......咦，斯普莉雅人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她已經進去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？那個女人什麼時候——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘖！不能讓你們拉特蘭的人在這撒野！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們兩個，不是要見主教閣下嗎，跟我來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......也好，這是同意我們進去的意思，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我警告你們，別想著和那個女人一樣亂跑——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好了！快、快來人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克萊芒？怎麼了，發生什麼事了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊蒙德！太好了，快通知其他人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有敵襲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，是的！不對，萊蒙德，這兩位是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別管他們！具體是什麼情況？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對，對......不好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛修繕窗戶時，看到不遠處有些動靜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前的那群強盜，他們又來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
